# 注意：带内部斜杠的模式会被锚定到仓库根，跨层级必须用 **/ 前缀

# ===== 实验产物与输出：绝不入库 =====
# 只保留模板与汇总索引
**/experiments/*
!**/experiments/_template/
!**/experiments/_template/**
!**/experiments/index.csv
**/outputs/
**/runs/
**/wandb/
**/mlruns/

# ===== 数据与权重：只保留清单 =====
**/data/*
!**/data/README.md
!**/data/manifest.json
**/weights/*
!**/weights/README.md
!**/weights/manifest.json

# ===== 第三方工程走 submodule，不提交内容 =====
**/third_party/*/
!**/third_party/README.md

# ===== Python =====
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ===== 测试与静态检查缓存 =====
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# ===== 编辑器与系统 =====
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ===== 密钥与本地配置 =====
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ===== 临时与日志 =====
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak

# ===== 大文件兜底 =====
# 若以后测试夹具需要这些格式，用 !tests/fixtures/** 单独放行
*.pkl
*.npy
*.npz
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.engine
*.h5
*.ckpt
